{
  "_comment": "用于隔离环境核验飞书回调，不生成二维码。",
  "card": {
    "schema": "2.0",
    "config": {
      "width_mode": "fill",
      "update_multi": true
    },
    "header": {
      "title": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "微信恢复原生卡片离线测试卡（无副作用）"
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "tag": "plain_text",
        "content": "仅验证飞书回调与可信上下文，不改状态、不发真实 QR"
      },
      "template": "wathet",
      "text_tag_list": [
        {
          "tag": "text_tag",
          "text": {
            "tag": "plain_text",
            "content": "无副作用测试"
          },
          "color": "turquoise"
        }
      ]
    },
    "body": {
      "direction": "vertical",
      "elements": [
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "content": "点击下方按钮只会触发 `/wechat_recovery test-card`，在 OpenClaw 2026.6.5 插件层回执可信群与操作者诊断信息，不请求 `feishu-choice` 也不生成第二张卡片。"
        },
        {
          "tag": "column_set",
          "flex_mode": "flow",
          "horizontal_spacing": "8px",
          "columns": [
            {
              "tag": "column",
              "width": "auto",
              "elements": [
                {
                  "tag": "button",
                  "text": {
                    "tag": "plain_text",
                    "content": "测试原生回调（无副作用）"
                  },
                  "type": "primary",
                  "width": "default",
                  "behaviors": [
                    {
                      "type": "callback",
                      "value": {
                        "action": "wechat-recovery:test-card default",
                        "oc": "ocf1",
                        "k": "quick",
                        "a": "wechat-recovery:test-card",
                        "q": "/wechat_recovery test-card default",
                        "c": {
                          "t": "group"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tag": "markdown",
          "text_size": "notation",
          "content": "wechat-digest · test-card（示例卡片，严禁向生产群直接发送或写入真实凭据）"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
